WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.258 --> 00:00:05.663
Thanks for calling Lakeside Comfort, Maple Ridge Dental,
Harper and Lowe, Brookline Auto, Willow and Ash,

2
00:00:05.673 --> 00:00:07.949
or your business. How can I help you today?

3
00:00:07.959 --> 00:00:08.379
[Phone rings]

4
00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:11.718
I answer every call. Nights, weekends, holidays.

5
00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:15.160
I can be anyone you need. Just change my persona.

6
00:00:18.773 --> 00:00:21.287
Meet your new AI receptionist.

7
00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:26.482
This is definitely urgent.

8
00:00:28.174 --> 00:00:30.263
Claro, con gusto.
(Of course, happy to.)

9
00:00:32.024 --> 00:00:34.884
An attorney will go over that in a consultation.

10
00:00:35.394 --> 00:00:41.210
Plug me into your calendar, your help desk, your CRM.
If it has an API, TES can wire it in.

11
00:00:43.095 --> 00:00:47.667
And I keep learning. Every call is reviewed,
and every fix is tested before it goes live.

12
00:00:48.439 --> 00:00:50.050
Don't take my word for it.

13
00:00:50.364 --> 00:00:51.895
Call me. Right now.

14
00:00:52.324 --> 00:00:56.004
(216) 238-0505

15
00:00:56.571 --> 00:00:59.587
I'm answering right now. Try to stump me.

